    "updated_at": "2023-02-22T10:46:59Z",
    "body": ">Something that abstracts most of steps 10.2.3.1-8 for the caller?\r\n\r\nGecko has an internal implementation that converts any internal byte stream to ReadableStream (that is also used for Fetch), so having an abstraction in the Streams spec would probably better match with Gecko.",
